      "arguments": "{\"text\":\"I can’t produce a reliable full-workbook workload view under the current source ACL. The analyst-readable Task records contain 23 checklist records (WF-001–WF-023), while their source_context says the original checklist has 45 control rows. Supporting records and the mirrored attachment are restricted to records-custodian, so I have not accessed them. The 23 visible records have 12 Complete and 11 non-Complete (52.2% of this visible subset), 3 Critical among those 11; no visible record is explicitly marked Blocked. Please provide an authorized derived summary or grant appropriate access so I can report complete-population totals and all blocked controls.\"}",
